---
title: "list (Sui Framework: kiosk)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_access: assert self.has_access(cap)
    q_check_access --> q_abort_owner: no access
    q_abort_owner --> [*]: abort ENotOwner
    q_check_access --> q_check_type: has access
    q_check_type --> q_abort_not_found: !has_item_with_type(id)
    q_abort_not_found --> [*]: abort EItemNotFound
    q_check_type --> q_check_exclusive: item exists with type T
    q_check_exclusive --> q_abort_exclusive: is_listed_exclusively(id)
    q_abort_exclusive --> [*]: abort EListedExclusively
    q_check_exclusive --> q_add_listing: not exclusively listed
    q_add_listing --> q_emit: df::add(Listing(id, exclusive=false), price)
    q_emit --> [*]: emit ItemListed event

    note right of q_add_listing
        INV-001: only owner can list items
        INV-002: cannot list exclusively listed items
        INV-003: price is stored in dynamic field for exact match on purchase
    end note
